{"unit_id":"suis077__dsh-companion#card-zh","repo":"suis077/dsh-companion","commit":"f00962bec025bbc82b4330ae9d3f17e6474746d1","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Persona Card（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为 DSH 会话注入可复用的人设卡，并保存角色跨会话记忆。插件通过 systemPrompt 服务添加动态提示段，并提供 persona_card 工具和右下角浮层面板。主要功能包括创建和切换人设卡、按会话启用或关闭人设、记忆回忆与心情和好感度调整，以及查看按卡归因的使用账目；还可把卡片绑定的图像和音效同步到鲸鱼挂件。适合希望在不同会话沿用角色设定、同时分别管理会话人设的 DSH Web 用户。卡片及记忆保存在本机 DSH 数据目录；没有必需的 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:401-452","index.js:483-805","client/client.js:1-30","lib/cards.mjs:25-37"]}
{"unit_id":"suis077__dsh-companion#card-en","repo":"suis077/dsh-companion","commit":"f00962bec025bbc82b4330ae9d3f17e6474746d1","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Persona Card is a DSH Web plugin that injects reusable character personas into system prompts. Manage cards and per-session overrides with a panel or tool, retain memories, view usage by card, and sync bound images and sounds to the whale widget. Data is stored locally; no API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:401-452","index.js:483-805","client/client.js:1-30","lib/cards.mjs:25-37"]}
