{"unit_id":"suis077__dsh-companion#feature-1","repo":"suis077/dsh-companion","commit":"f00962bec025bbc82b4330ae9d3f17e6474746d1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Persona Card 的功能「系统提示人设注入」：将当前生效卡片的人设正文和解除触发词加入 DSH 系统提示。每轮提示组装时重新解析卡片，切换或关闭会话人设后即可使用对应设定。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:401-428"]}
{"unit_id":"suis077__dsh-companion#feature-2","repo":"suis077/dsh-companion","commit":"f00962bec025bbc82b4330ae9d3f17e6474746d1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Persona Card 的功能「按会话管理人设」：可为当前会话跟随全局卡片、指定卡片或关闭注入，其他会话的设置保持独立。通过 persona_card 工具或 Web 面板查看和更改会话状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/sessions.mjs:1-18","index.js:483-550","client/client.js:1-30"]}
{"unit_id":"suis077__dsh-companion#feature-3","repo":"suis077/dsh-companion","commit":"f00962bec025bbc82b4330ae9d3f17e6474746d1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Persona Card 的功能「跨会话角色记忆」：用 persona_card 的 remember、recall、mood 和 affinity 动作记录或读取每张卡的摘要、心情、性格关键词与好感度；记忆会在后续会话的人设提示中呈现。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:676-765","lib/memory.mjs:1-40"]}
{"unit_id":"suis077__dsh-companion#feature-4","repo":"suis077/dsh-companion","commit":"f00962bec025bbc82b4330ae9d3f17e6474746d1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Persona Card 的功能「使用量账目」：工具和网页面板显示今日、近七日及累计用量，并根据记录的人设生效时间将相关账目归到卡片。账本读取自鲸鱼挂件的数据文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:570-673","lib/usage.mjs:1-40"]}
{"unit_id":"suis077__dsh-companion#feature-5","repo":"suis077/dsh-companion","commit":"f00962bec025bbc82b4330ae9d3f17e6474746d1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Persona Card 的功能「角色资源同步」：创建卡片或调用 sync 动作时，可将卡片绑定的角色图、按下或释放音效、气泡图片同步到鲸鱼挂件对应资源目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:536-566","lib/whale.mjs:1-45"]}
